.TH TAGPLAY-GUI 1 "2026-11-02" "tagplay 0.9" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tagplay-gui \- SDL2 face of tagplay with instrument panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tagplay-gui
.RB [ \-\-selftest ]
.IR MUSIC_DIR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tagplay-gui
is the graphical face of
.BR tagplay (1):
the same library core, the same controller, the same query language
and
.B :
commands, rendered with SDL2.  Everything in
.BR tagplay (1)'s
QUERY LANGUAGE, VIEWS AND KEYS and COMMANDS sections applies
verbatim \(em the two faces share one code path \(em with these
additions:
.TP
.B F2
Toggles the instrument panel: full-file waveform with playback
cursor, dual spectrum analyzer (clean signal dim, processed signal
accented, EMA or boxcar averaging), the effect-mode buttons, the
macro amount knob, per-parameter sliders for the current mode, and a
live THD / H2 / H3 / noise readout re-measured shortly after each
tweak.
.TP
.B mouse
Mode buttons, sliders, the volume bar, seek bar and transport
buttons are clickable; sliders drag.
.TP
.B \-\-selftest
Run the scripted headless self-test against a fixture library made
by
.IR tests/make_fixtures.sh ;
it refuses a real music collection.  Exits non-zero on any failed
check.
.SH FILES
Shares every file in
.BR tagplay (1)'s
FILES section, cache and playlists included.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tagplay (1),
.BR tagview (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mico Mrkaic.  GPL-3.0-or-later.
